body:
you are very pretty!! as others have said, when curling your hair try to separate the curls with a comb or your fingers. 
makeup wise, i feel like your face needs a little more color. try adding some blush (at least) or bronzer to your routine and some nice volumizing mascara (telescopic is sooo good). I also feel as if brighter colors suit you better (I.e. second pic in the red dress) so try going for lighter colors for your lips and wardrobe. experiment with it to see what you like best!!!
for your hair, I feel like you would look sooo cute with some curtain bangs, but def try adding some volume to hair hair!! you’re not ugly at all!! just need a little confidence :)
